#: docs/design/i3c-controller.md:1
msgid "Bounded I3C controller core"
msgstr "Bounded I3C controller core"

#: docs/design/i3c-controller.md:3
msgid ""
"This contract explains how an external controller port uses the optional "
"`Nexus::I3CController` C11 core for explicit discovery, finite SDR transfers "
"and copied IBI/hot-join events. Current production F4 integration does not "
"expose an I3C hardware adapter. External C preparation and trusted wire, IRQ "
"and all-target address-reset proofs remain required by any future concrete "
"port."
msgstr ""
"This contract explains how an external controller port uses the optional "
"`Nexus::I3CController` C11 core for explicit discovery, finite SDR transfers "
"and copied IBI/hot-join events. Current production F4 integration does not "
"expose an I3C hardware adapter. External C preparation and trusted wire, IRQ "
"and all-target address-reset proofs remain required by any future concrete "
"port."

#: docs/design/i3c-controller.md:9
msgid ""
"The public contracts are [request and endpoint API](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/i3c_controller/include/nexus/components/i3c_controller.h) "
"and [caller storage and port contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/i3c_controller/include/nexus/components/i3c_controller_storage.h)."
" The caller supplies one controller object, a PID/address policy table, "
"target state records, an event ring, request metadata, payloads, a monotonic "
"clock and one immutable hardware operations table. There are no workers, "
"object pools, implicit discovery or OS locks. One serialized thread executor "
"calls every API; these APIs do not establish concurrent or IRQ access safety."
" Every hardware leaf and injected clock callback must be non-reentrant and "
"must not call the core, invoke application code or mutate retained core "
"storage."
msgstr ""
"The public contracts are [request and endpoint API](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/i3c_controller/include/nexus/components/i3c_controller.h) "
"and [caller storage and port contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/i3c_controller/include/nexus/components/i3c_controller_storage.h)."
" The caller supplies one controller object, a PID/address policy table, "
"target state records, an event ring, request metadata, payloads, a monotonic "
"clock and one immutable hardware operations table. There are no workers, "
"object pools, implicit discovery or OS locks. One serialized thread executor "
"calls every API; these APIs do not establish concurrent or IRQ access safety."
" Every hardware leaf and injected clock callback must be non-reentrant and "
"must not call the core, invoke application code or mutate retained core "
"storage."

