#: docs/design/i3c-controller.md:127
msgid ""
"Host GoogleTest/GoogleMock exercises the actual C core with external port "
"behavior modeled. Such tests do not establish physical discovery, SDA timing,"
" IBI/hot-join or all-target reset. The retired hardware reference remains "
"available at its original source revision and does not qualify a new port by "
"inheritance. Physical HIL is not executed."
msgstr ""
"Host GoogleTest/GoogleMock exercises the actual C core with external port "
"behavior modeled. Such tests do not establish physical discovery, SDA timing,"
" IBI/hot-join or all-target reset. The retired hardware reference remains "
"available at its original source revision and does not qualify a new port by "
"inheritance. Physical HIL is not executed."
